## 4. Booking & Payment Sequence Diagram

<!-- eraser-diagram -->
```
User [icon: user, color: blue] > Frontend [icon: monitor, color: blue]: Select workshop, guests, date
Frontend > API [icon: server, color: purple]: POST /api/bookings/hold
API > Database [icon: database, color: green]: RPC create_booking_hold()

activate Database
Database > Database: Atomically decrement seats, create 15-min hold
deactivate Database

Database > API: hold_id
API > Frontend: hold_id + expiry timer

User > Frontend: Fill guest info, proceed to pay
Frontend > API: POST /api/bookings/checkout
API > Razorpay [icon: credit-card, color: blue]: Create Razorpay Order
Razorpay > API: order_id
API > Frontend: order_id + key

Frontend > Razorpay: Open Checkout Modal
User > Razorpay: Complete Payment
Razorpay > Frontend: payment_id, signature

Frontend > API: POST /api/payments/razorpay (verify)

activate API
API > API: Verify HMAC signature
deactivate API

API > Database: RPC confirm_booking_from_hold()

activate Database
Database > Database: Hold confirmed, Booking created, Earning entry added
deactivate Database

Database > API: booking_id
API > "Resend Email" [icon: mail, color: orange]: Send confirmation email
"Resend Email" > User: Booking Confirmation Email
API > Frontend: Success + booking details

// CRON note
opt [label: Every 5 minutes] {
  API > Database: Release expired holds, restore seats
}
```
<!-- end-eraser-diagram -->

