## 6. Host Onboarding & Earnings Flow

<!-- eraser-diagram -->
```
// Host Onboarding Flow

"Creator or Venue visits Become a Host" [shape: oval, icon: user-plus, color: blue]
"Application Type?" [shape: diamond, icon: help-circle, color: orange]

"Creator Path" [color: green] {
  "Fill Creator Details" [icon: edit, color: green]
}

"Venue Path" [color: blue] {
  "Fill Venue Details" [icon: map-pin, color: blue]
}

"Submit Application" [icon: send, color: purple]
"Admin Reviews" [icon: shield, color: red]
"Application Decision?" [shape: diamond, icon: check-circle, color: orange]
"Profile Role set to Host" [icon: check, color: green]
"Rejection Notification" [icon: x, color: red]
"Create Workshops" [icon: plus, color: green]
"Workshops Go Live" [icon: globe, color: green]
"Users Book Workshops" [icon: shopping-cart, color: blue]
"Earning Created per Booking" [icon: dollar-sign, color: green]
"Admin Processes Payout" [icon: credit-card, color: purple]
"Host Receives Payment" [shape: oval, icon: check-circle, color: green]

// Connections
"Creator or Venue visits Become a Host" > "Application Type?"
"Application Type?" > "Fill Creator Details": Creator
"Application Type?" > "Fill Venue Details": Venue
"Fill Creator Details" > "Submit Application"
"Fill Venue Details" > "Submit Application"
"Submit Application" > "Admin Reviews"
"Admin Reviews" > "Application Decision?"
"Application Decision?" > "Profile Role set to Host": Approved
"Application Decision?" > "Rejection Notification": Rejected
"Profile Role set to Host" > "Create Workshops"
"Create Workshops" > "Workshops Go Live"
"Workshops Go Live" > "Users Book Workshops"
"Users Book Workshops" > "Earning Created per Booking"
"Earning Created per Booking" > "Admin Processes Payout"
"Admin Processes Payout" > "Host Receives Payment"
```
<!-- end-eraser-diagram -->

