## 13. Three-Actor Platform Model

<!-- eraser-diagram -->
```
// Three-Actor Platform Model

"Learner (User)" [icon: user, color: blue]
"OnlyWorkshop Platform" [icon: layers, color: purple]
"Creator / Host" [icon: briefcase, color: green]
"Venue / Space" [icon: map-pin, color: orange]
"Payment Gateway" [icon: credit-card, color: blue]
"Admin Team" [icon: shield, color: red]

// Connections
"Learner (User)" > "OnlyWorkshop Platform": Browse, Search, Book
"OnlyWorkshop Platform" > "Learner (User)": Workshop Listings, Confirmations
"Creator / Host" > "OnlyWorkshop Platform": Create Workshops, Manage Bookings
"OnlyWorkshop Platform" > "Creator / Host": Bookings, Earnings, Payouts
"Venue / Space" > "OnlyWorkshop Platform": Register Space, List Amenities
"OnlyWorkshop Platform" > "Venue / Space": Bookings, Revenue Share
"OnlyWorkshop Platform" <> "Payment Gateway": Payments, Refunds, Webhooks
"Admin Team" > "OnlyWorkshop Platform": Review Apps, Moderate, Process Payouts
```
<!-- end-eraser-diagram -->

